th the settle-plus-guard shape, not the bare banner wait) matches your C4 table; add no code, no mutant and no finding above Note. (e) Process and what is left: nothing of yours running; your lock released by move to `.tools/b659/quarantine/locks/`; every scratch change restored byte-equal (sha256; `git status` clean in `-head` and `-main`); containers, networks, images and trees you created named with their state; no file, log or temp directory of yours left in the project outside `.tools/b659/` and the Briefs evidence folder; refs before/after in YOUR clone: added only `refs/remotes/origin/*` and your named scratch branches, removed 0 (control: a dropped name is reported); no ref on origin, no PR comment, no push; `lsof -nP -iTCP:9950-9959 -sTCP:LISTEN` rc 1 at the end. Evidence hygiene: your STATUS and evidence hold 0 non-ASCII bytes (`LC_ALL=C /usr/bin/grep -c '[^ -~]'`, control: a planted raw byte counts 1; build any Unicode value from code points and write it as an escape), no person's name, no decision-card slug, no four-underscore run.
