n before the last line: the ticket's four-busy-loop hog at load 13 to 14, `ci:node` x10 under load, GitHub-hosted runners, a Linux CI run, the web e2e, a quieter machine, a rejection later than the window, anything you could not drive and why). **Last line of STATUS, exactly one of:** `VERDICT: B659 pr90 b631/composer-test-wait-and-comment @ <sha7> <GO|GO WITH FOLLOW-UPS|NO GO> (round 2 of 2; CI <complete|pending: names>) on main <sha7>` (head sha7 by `ls-remote`, main sha7 by `ls-remote` at the verdict) / `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY` + ONE question.

